# oracle: ELECTRODE graph-il in.graph-il-conp cut to run 0 (settings.mod inlined, with the example's fix shake on the BMI bonds and angle): pppm/electrode slab 3.0, fix electrode/conp mat_inv, symm on
# Compared at the tolerance of w68elec_graphil_pppm_inv (rel 1e-6); fix shake setup forces match since #166
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): G vector 0.20904498, grid 32 32 200, order 5 (pppm/electrode 1e-7, slab 3.0); the engine chooses the same G and grid itself (no kspace_modify gewald/mesh)
# oracle-inputs: w68elec_graphil.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-6 abs=1e-9
units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p f
kspace_style    pppm/electrode 1e-7
kspace_modify   slab 3.0
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long 16
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic
read_data       w68elec_graphil.data
variable        zpos atom "z > 0"
group           zpos variable zpos
group           ele type 5
group           top intersect ele zpos
group           bot subtract ele top
group           electrolyte type 1 2 3 4
group           bmi type 1 2 3
fix             nvt electrolyte nvt temp 500.0 500.0 100
variable        q atom q
compute         qtop top reduce sum v_q
compute         qbot bot reduce sum v_q
compute         ctemp electrolyte temp
fix             shake bmi shake 1e-4 20 0 b 1 2 a 1
fix             conp bot electrode/conp -1.0 1.979 couple top 1.0 symm on
thermo_style    custom step temp c_ctemp epair etotal c_qbot c_qtop f_conp
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
